### Commands
Conda was activated.
```
conda activate snps
```

Shell script was created for each sample in the structure below:

```
Nano Sample_A_R.sh

bwa-mem2 mem \
-t 2 \
sacCer3.fa \
Sample_A_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz \
Sample_A_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz \
| \
samtools sort \
-@ 2 \
-o Sample_A_R.sorted.bam \

Bash Sample_A_R.sh
```


```
samtools stat Sample_A_R.sorted.bam > Sample_A_R.stats
```

